  "reasoning": "The evaluation failed due to MessageAPI instance state mismatch, not tool-call syntax errors. The model made a critical violation in Turn 3 by calling get_user_id('Emma') before send_message, which violates delta4 and delta6 requiring atomic login→send sequences without exploratory lookups when recipient context is available.",
